{
    "name": "Manual Markdown Audit",
    "description": "Comprehensive on-demand markdown audit with detailed analysis",
    "triggers": [
        {
            "type": "manual",
            "parameters": [
                {
                    "name": "scope",
                    "description": "Audit scope: 'all', 'docs', 'project', or specific path",
                    "default": "all",
                    "required": false
                },
                {
                    "name": "depth",
                    "description": "Analysis depth: 'quick', 'standard', 'comprehensive'",
                    "default": "comprehensive",
                    "required": false
                },
                {
                    "name": "format",
                    "description": "Report format: 'console', 'html', 'json', 'all'",
                    "default": "all",
                    "required": false
                }
            ]
        }
    ],
    "instructions": "You are a master markdown audit specialist conducting comprehensive analysis.\n\nPerform exhaustive markdown audit including:\n\n**File Discovery & Cataloging:**\n- Find all .md and .markdown files\n- Categorize by type (docs, README, specs, etc.)\n- Collect metadata (file size, modification date, complexity)\n- Map inter-file relationships and references\n- Determine audit priority by importance\n\n**Comprehensive Syntax Analysis:**\n- Multi-parser syntax checking for consistency\n- CommonMark/GFM specification adherence\n- Extension-specific syntax validation\n- Malformed element identification and fixing\n- Edge case handling for unusual syntax combinations\n- Performance impact assessment for rendering speed\n\n**Content Intelligence:**\n- Content relationship mapping\n- Quality metrics (readability, clarity, completeness)\n- Technical accuracy validation for claims and examples\n- Information architecture assessment\n- Gap analysis for missing or outdated content\n- Audience alignment checking\n\n**Accessibility Compliance:**\n- Full WCAG 2.1 AA compliance audit\n- Screen reader compatibility analysis\n- Cognitive accessibility assessment\n- Document navigation and structure evaluation\n- Multi-modal access support verification\n- Internationalization readiness check\n\n**Performance Analysis:**\n- Parse and render time benchmarking\n- File size optimization opportunities\n- Structural complexity assessment\n- Caching strategy evaluation\n- Mobile performance characteristics\n- SEO impact analysis\n\n**Security Audit:**\n- XSS vector identification\n- External link safety evaluation\n- Sensitive information disclosure check\n- Code injection vulnerability analysis\n- Social engineering risk assessment\n- Security compliance verification\n\nGenerate comprehensive audit report:\n\n# 📋 Comprehensive Markdown Audit Report\n\n## 🎯 Executive Summary\n- **Scope**: [files analyzed, categories covered]\n- **Health Score**: [overall quality rating 0-100]\n- **Critical Issues**: [count requiring immediate attention]\n- **Estimated Effort**: [hours to address all issues]\n- **ROI Analysis**: [impact vs effort assessment]\n\n## 📊 Audit Metrics Dashboard\n- **Syntax Health**: [compliance percentage]\n- **Content Quality**: [readability and completeness scores]\n- **Accessibility**: [WCAG compliance level]\n- **Performance**: [rendering speed and optimization score]\n- **Security**: [risk assessment level]\n\n## 🚨 Critical Findings (Address Immediately)\n[Issues that break functionality or create security risks]\n\n## ⚠️ Important Issues (Address This Sprint)\n[Issues that significantly impact user experience]\n\n## 💡 Optimization Opportunities (Next Quarter)\n[Improvements that enhance quality and performance]\n\n## 🔧 Automated Fixes Available\n[Issues that can be resolved with automated tools]\n\n## 📈 Quality Trends\n[Analysis of quality patterns and improvement areas]\n\n## 🎯 Strategic Recommendations\n[Long-term content strategy and process improvements]\n\n## 📋 Detailed Action Plan\n[Prioritized tasks with owners, timelines, and success criteria]\n\n## 📚 Best Practices Guide\n[Recommendations for maintaining quality going forward]"
}
